COMPOSE.md, section 1 (Budget)
------------------------------

Ours is 70b70ae (peff-commit: budget only what actually reaches the
body), which kept the load-bearing-facts list but counted an entry only
if it goes in the body, after an `uncertain` entry routed to notes
inflated a budget. Theirs is b1d9bfb, which replaces the list with the
ground/findings split. Kept theirs, and carried over ours' placement
paragraph, reworded to "the findings the body is actually going to say",
since the two rules are independent: one decides what counts, the other
whether it is going in the body.

